// x10 "My Own Business" (script v2, 2026-10-25, docs/x10-my-own-business.md). Ross's idea: he opens his own business, then every shot somebody needs
// something (bring, serve, buy, pay, hire, fire, fix), he counts what is left and still owes the tax office, and at 5 pm a guy walks home whistling.
// Ross: "if it's funny, do it". Ross plays himself (jack-tyler, as in x08 and x09). The whistles, the kettle and the corks are sounds, not voice lines.
// Format: see scripts/voice-gen.mjs (lines, directions) and scripts/voice-build.py (cast, plan, gaps, lead, tableSfx). Take k of a line uses direction k.
